msgid "Only starts the local proxy. System proxy is a separate switch."
msgstr "只启动本机代理。系统代理另外开关。"

msgid "Restart with the current configuration."
msgstr "按当前配置重新启动。"

msgid "While the core is running, KDE applications use it. Turning the core off withdraws it."
msgstr "内核运行时，KDE 应用程序使用它。内核停止后会撤回。"

msgid "Rule follows the profile. Global sends everything through the proxy. Direct connects directly."
msgstr "规则按配置分流。全局全部走代理。直连全部直接连接。"

msgid "Applications can use this address directly."
msgstr "其他软件可以手动填写这个地址。"

msgid "Look up the exit region through the current proxy."
msgstr "通过当前代理查询出口地区。"

msgid "HTTP and SOCKS share this port. Applying restarts a running core."
msgstr "HTTP 和 SOCKS 共用这个端口。应用后如果内核在运行，会重新启动。"

msgid "Used by this page. It listens only on this computer."
msgstr "供这个页面读取状态，只监听本机。"

msgid "The mihomo program installed on the system."
msgstr "系统里的 mihomo 程序。"

msgid "Merged on top of the subscription. The listen address is still set here."
msgstr "合并到订阅之上。监听地址仍由这里决定。"
